41:["$","p",null,{"children":["Forge's unit of storage configuration: a named thing that gets and puts\nbytes under a key. Stores compose, because a store's backend is another store,\nso the CAS a server serves is usually a stack of wrappers over one real\nbackend. See ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/explanations/store-model","children":"the store model"}],"."]}]
